# Lakeside Minuet (jeuno 95) accepted at Prog 5 (a GM; the quest ends at 4): Valderotaux 889 (Prog >= 2), Rhea Myuliah
# nil (no arm for 5): her default 10121, the csid her Prog 4 arm plays too.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Valderotaux/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Rhea_Myuliah/onTrigger
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=99.1,0,113.7 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Jeuno.LakesideMinuet accepted
charvar Quest[3][95]Prog 5
login
trigger Valderotaux                     # Prog 5: 889
finish
warp -52.5,0,101 UpperJeuno
trigger Rhea_Myuliah                    # Prog 5: nil; her default 10121
finish
